/02/03/9879483/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！聴きたいんなら貸すよ！ほれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。脱線したけど今日のお仕事の仕上がりも楽しみにしててね(•ө•)ぴよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか踊り出したくなるよ！(•ө•)ぴよぴよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/03/9879483/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝早かったからめちゃんこ眠いですー(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからもうそろそろ！ぐっどないと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーい( ^ω^ )\n明日からまた学校、お仕事、勉強に忙しいけども頑張ろうっっぅ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/03/9879483/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーむＮ揃って打ち合わせなしで\nシャツ×ニットという格好になってしまいましたとさ。ちゃんちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18164":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は収録したり撮影したり\nリハーサルしたりと忙しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559193/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さん、まあや\nお誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/27/6559